case ok-command-echo-err
desc a refused action on the chat transport
module yes
send chat action pull Zed
frame chat WHISPER_SELF .bot action pull Zed
recv system TBM:ACTION_ERR|pull|not-found|No bot named Zed.
expect err.count 1
expect err.0.intent pull
expect err.0.code not-found
expect err.0.message No bot named Zed.
expect ack.count 0
expect problems.count 0
